{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-color#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-color","commit":"9d9c72c1ad37a30b67e28942f7b454c3c6303215","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 是一个面向 DSH 的颜色工具插件，通过注册 color_convert 工具，让会话可以直接计算颜色信息。它接受 hex、rgb() 和 hsl() 颜色值，并返回 hex、RGB、HSL 表示、补色、颜色明暗判断，以及针对黑色和白色文字的对比度和建议前景色。适合需要快速检查界面颜色、选择前景文字颜色或在多种颜色格式之间转换的开发者。工具在本地使用 Node.js 计算，不需要额外密钥、账号或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67-115","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-color#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-color","commit":"9d9c72c1ad37a30b67e28942f7b454c3c6303215","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-color adds a color_convert tool to DSH. It converts hex, rgb(), and hsl() values and reports a complementary color, light or dark classification, contrast against black and white, and a suggested text color. Useful for palette checks; calculations run locally with no extra key or service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67-115","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
